Tips: {
	T0: If you are struggling to overcome a challenge, maybe try doing something different. Don't bang your head against the wall!
	T1: There are all sorts of secrets and treasures to uncover in the world of Lunar Veil, you definitely won't find them all.
	T2: If you think you need a new piece of equipment, try brewing something up in the Magic Cauldron at Witch Town!
	T3: If you ever feel down, just remember we've died thousands of times trying to make these bosses perfect!
	T4: Your mom
	T5: The sin of lust, Ereshkigal is a very formiddable foe, you should not try and fight her!!
	T6: There are fights you are not meant to win...
	T7: The world is humongous! Go out and search for things! There are so many different areas to help go past your progression to get stronger!
	T8: Do not lust to Ereshkigal
	T9: Fun fact! Every moth/butterfly you see in lunar veil is a soul that was morphed into those animals to keep alive for power.
	T10: There are only 2 devs on this mod! Zenovia and Scolon!
	T11: Check your book for getting updates on where to go and what to do! It's an in-built wiki!
	T12: Dodging is very important, every boss is balanced around melee and dodging so you can no-hit any boss!
	T13: The npcs can be quest givers in this game, sometimes their quests even reveal hidden bosses, so go talk to them!
	T14: Running is useless.
	T15: This game is very aggressive, Lunar veil will not baby you!
	T16: There are 3 acts and 52 bosses in total for the mod, good luck beating them all!
	T17: If you are getting ready to play, please start in expert mode for our base experience!
	T18: This is not gooner veil
	T19: Oh my lunar veils...
	T20: In master mode, get free refights through the new master relics by right-clicking them!
	T21: Keep going! Don't give up :)
	T22: Speedrunning and overpowered builds are available, the player can easily minmax in this mod, so play smart.
	T23: Calamity is overrated, lunar veil clears obviously :)
	T24: If you have an issue with any of our visual effects, we have plenty of options to tune them in our configs!
	T25: There are 100 songs in total in the album!
	T26: It is canon that Verlia is freed!
	T27: In total there are 5 true secret bosses, but there are plenty of others who are hidden away who could count as one too!
	T28: Feel free to make whatever builds you want, there is so much variety in the new added stats!
	T29: Remember, Delgrim in the witchtown, can class swap certain weapons, just look at the weapon you have and ask!
	T30: Go collect some glistening pearls underground and go to Veldris to upgrade your armor!
	T31: Dragonshards are important! Sometimes saving them is better than using them...
	T32: Need to respec? Go to Reskinance in hallowrooms during act II and above!
	T33: Zui will always have all the mainline quests for you, so check your book frequently if you get lost, she also marks your map!
	T34: Use the waypoints! They save so much time when it comes to traveling across a really large world!
	T35: Every class has plenty of options, so if a specific weapon doesn't get the job done, switch to your secondary!
	T36: Every weapon has a use.
	T37: Remember to use your Xixian flask! It's especially important on insource builds.
	T38: Left shift when you're hovering over items to see more information!
	T39: Updates in this mod happen timely! So if this is your first time playing, welcome to Lunar veil, thanks for playing :)
	T40: I really appreciate and love you for playing this mod, I spent a lot of time on it so thank you!! - Zenovia
	T41: If you want to read lore and check up on boss locations, look in your book, there's a built in boss checklist for you!
	T42: Brewing is the crafting of this game, so if you don't know where items are, maybe try brewing!
	T43: All items that you brew will be in your book! Theres a tab with every item you've collected and all you've missed!
	T44: Stamina is very very important, make sure you don't overspend all the time and run out of dodges!
	T45: She lunar on my veil until I 2.0
}
